 enchanted desk and spend some time to discover your inner magic.","steam_appid":2364180,"support_info":{"email":"fairy@themerryfairy.se","url":"www.themerryfairy.se"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://TheMerryFairy.se/"}